# Bundle Staging Directory

This is **NOT** the source of truth.

## Purpose

- Synced from `driver-ui/` (development source of truth) before bundle
- Included in installer packages
- Temporary staging area for bundling process

## Important

**Do NOT edit files here directly.**

All modifications must be made to the source directory (`driver-ui/`), then synced here.

## Sync Procedure

Before running `npm run tauri build` (or equivalent bundle command):

```powershell
npm run driver-suite:stage
# or manually:
# .\ops\scripts\stage-driver-artifacts.ps1
```

This ensures installer includes the latest artifacts from the development source of truth.

---

See [../../../driver-ui/.deploymentinfo](../../../driver-ui/.deploymentinfo) for source of truth layout.
